step	1	-	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>General Wartface</col> and <col=800000>General Bentnoze</col> in <col=800000>Goblin Village</col>. They've been trying to pick a new colour of armour for the goblins in the village, but have been unable to agree on a colour. I offered to help, so they asked me to bring them some <col=800000>Orange Goblin Mail</col> to try out. Perhaps they'll have an idea on how I can get some.</col>
step	2	-	After giving the generals orange goblin mail
line	<str>I spoke to General Wartface and General Bentnoze in Goblin Village. They were trying to pick a new colour of armour for the goblins in the village, but were unable to agree on a colour. I offered to help, so they asked me to bring them some Orange Goblin Mail to try out.</str>
line	<col=000080>I gave some <col=800000>Orange Goblin Mail</col> to <col=800000>General Wartface</col> and <col=800000>General Bentnoze</col>, but they didn't like it. They asked me to bring them some <col=800000>Blue Goblin Mail</col> to try out instead. <col=800000>Aggie</col> in <col=800000>Draynor Village</col> can make some <col=800000>Dye</col> for me to recolour <col=800000>Goblin Mail</col> with. I should be able to find some <col=800000>Goblin Mail</col> in crates around <col=800000>Goblin Village</col>.</col>
step	3	-	After giving the generals blue goblin mail
line	<str>I spoke to General Wartface and General Bentnoze in Goblin Village. They were trying to pick a new colour of armour for the goblins in the village, but were unable to agree on a colour. I offered to help, so they asked me to bring them some Orange Goblin Mail to try out.</str>
line	<str>I gave some Orange Goblin Mail to General Wartface and General Bentnoze, but they didn't like it. They asked me to bring them some Blue Goblin Mail to try out instead.</str>
line	<col=000080>I gave some <col=800000>Blue Goblin Mail</col> to <col=800000>General Wartface</col> and <col=800000>General Bentnoze</col>, but they didn't like it. They asked me to bring them some of their original <col=800000>Brown Goblin Mail</col> to try out instead. I should be able to find some <col=800000>Brown Goblin Mail</col> in crates around <col=800000>Goblin Village</col>.</col>
