done	<str>I gave some Orange Goblin Mail to General Wartface and General Bentnoze, but they didn't like it. They asked me to bring them some Blue Goblin Mail to try out instead.</str>
done	<str>I gave some Blue Goblin Mail to General Wartface and General Bentnoze, but they didn't like it. They asked me to bring them some of their original Brown Goblin Mail to try out instead.</str>
done	<str>I gave General Wartface and General Bentnoze some of the original Brown Goblin Mail, and it turned out to be their favourite. They're clearly not the smartest, but that's goblins for you.</str>
